# Issue #71: Wi-Fi mode + credentials for this test build.
#
# Copy this file to wifi_credentials.conf (same directory) and edit it -
# wifi_credentials.conf is gitignored and must never be committed. The build
# picks it up automatically (firmware/app/CMakeLists.txt adds it as an extra
# Kconfig fragment if present) - no extra west flag needed.
#
# Pick ONE mode below and fill in real values; delete or leave commented the
# other mode's block. CONFIG_WIFI_USAGE_MODE_* is Zephyr's own Wi-Fi driver
# mode choice (drivers/wifi/Kconfig) - see docs/adr/0009-wifi-web-transport.md.

# --- Mode 1: access point (the board creates its own Wi-Fi network) ---
# CONFIG_WIFI_USAGE_MODE_AP=y
# CONFIG_QC_WIFI_AP_SSID="QCRemote"
# CONFIG_QC_WIFI_AP_PSK="pick-a-real-wpa2-passphrase"

# --- Mode 2: station (the board joins your existing Wi-Fi network) ---
# CONFIG_WIFI_USAGE_MODE_STA=y
# CONFIG_QC_WIFI_STA_SSID="YourNetworkName"
# CONFIG_QC_WIFI_STA_PSK="YourNetworkPassword"
